[agent:result]       List of permissions to set on the job.
[agent:result]     :param budget_policy_id: str (optional)
[agent:result]       The id of the user specified budget policy to use for this job. If not specified, a default budget
[agent:result]       policy may be applied when creating or modifying the job. See `effective_budget_policy_id` for the
[agent:result]       budget policy used by this workload.
[agent:result]     :param continuous: :class:`Continuous` (optional)
